# Perform linting and code checks

Code linting and checks should be performed when given the [CHECK CODE] shortcode.

- Check all modified files for PHP compliance with the [phpcs.xml](mdc:family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/phpcs.xml) file
- Check all modified files for compliance with WordPress Coding Standards (WPCS)
- Check all modified files for uses of debug code (particularly dd() and d())
- Check all modified files for compliance with [.stylelintrc](mdc:family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/.stylelintrc)
- Check all modified files for compliance with [.prettierrc.js](mdc:family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/.prettierrc.js)
- Check all modified files for compliance with [.eslintrc.js](mdc:family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/family-recipe-book/.eslintrc.js)
